From: Jeremy Rose <nornagon@nornagon.net>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 08:09:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Revive Emscripten browser build

---
 Makefile                          | 12 ++++++------
 build-scripts/build-emscripten.sh | 17 ++++++++++-------
 src/debug.cpp                     |  2 +-
 src/do_turn.cpp                   |  4 ++--
 src/emscripten_exception.cpp      |  2 +-
 src/filesystem.cpp                |  4 ++--
 src/game.cpp                      |  6 +++---
 src/main.cpp                      | 10 +++++-----
